a-scotia-bns-q1-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"BNS 2018 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2018-05-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Porter","x":"At the enterprise level, I'm pleased to report that our structural cost reduction initiatives are one year ahead of schedule.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/29/bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q2-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"BNS 2018 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2018-05-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean McGuckin","x":"These were partially offset by the impact of the sale of HollisWealth last year, the positive impact of FX, and cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/29/bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q2-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"BNS 2018 Q4","e":"bns","d":"2018-11-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"Partly offsetting were the impact of further savings from cost-reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/27/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"BNS 2019 Q1","e":"bns","d":"2019-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"The balance of growth was driven by higher investment in regulatory initiatives, digital and technology, partly offset by the benefits from cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/26/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q1-2019-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"BNS 2019 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2019-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nacho Deschamps","x":"I would say, Sohrab, this is the opportunity that we have, especially driven by Pacific Alliance country, so solid loan, deposit, and revenue growth, and the very focused plan in international banking and the bank to capture cost savings as part of our performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/28/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"BNS 2019 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2019-08-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"We expect it to be in the range, but I'll probably pass it on to Ignacio to provide some more color.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/27/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"BNS 2020 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2020-08-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"Expenses declined significantly, down 11% year over year or 6% excluding the impact of divestitures, driven by acquisition synergies and cost-saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/25/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2020 Q4","e":"bns","d":"2020-12-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"I'll talk on some of the earnings projections that we talked about and then I'll pass it on to Nacho, if he wants to speak about specific countries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/01/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2021 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2021-08-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"So I'll talk on your margin question and then I'll pass it on to Nacho to talk about asset growth and revenue growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/24/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2021 Q4","e":"bns","d":"2021-11-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dan Rees","x":"Preorder bookings for vehicles are the highest that they have ever been and direct-to-consumer channels are roaring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/30/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2021 Q4","e":"bns","d":"2021-11-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"Let me start, Sohrab, and then I'll pass it on to Nacho.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/30/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2021 Q4","e":"bns","d":"2021-11-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Porter","x":"Raj will speak in more detail to this quarter's restructuring charge and related benefits driven by this accelerated adoption of digital channels in International Banking.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/30/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2021 Q4","e":"bns","d":"2021-11-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"The bank recorded a restructuring charge of $126 million, primarily related to the cost of reducing approximately 10% of the branches and approximately 7% of full-time employees mainly in the middle and back offices, driven by the accelerated customer adoption of digital channels and process…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/30/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2022 Q1","e":"bns","d":"2022-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"This was partly offset by the benefits of the Q4 2021 restructuring charge.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/01/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2022 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2022-05-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"So I won't get it into the details, so I'll pass it on to the two of them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/25/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2022 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2022-05-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"How about I pass it on to Dan?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/25/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2022 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2022-05-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"Noninterest expenses were in line with the prior year as expenses related to business growth and inflationary impact were offset by efficiency initiatives and the benefits from the 2021 restructuring charge, coupled with strong digital progress.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/25/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2022 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2022-05-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nacho Deschamps","x":"I have to say that it's very -- it's remarkable that our expenses are flat year over year even when inflation in these countries is around 8% driven by strong digital progress and the execution of the restructuring charge.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/25/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2022 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2022-08-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"And then I'll pass it on to Jake for additional specific to FX.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/23/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q3-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2022 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2022-08-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Raj Viswanathan","x":"I'll pass it on to Nacho to speak specifically about what you see in the Pacific Alliance countries relating to the margin compression this quarter compared to the expansion we saw in two quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/23/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q3-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2022 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2022-08-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nacho Deschamps","x":"So this is driven by very strong digital progress and timely execution of all efficiency gains that we committed with the restructuring charge last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/23/the-bank-of-nova-scotia-bns-q3-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BNS 2026 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2026-05-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"L. Thomson","x":"We are focused on improving returns while also growing our loan book and investing in critical technology, including AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/29/bns-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BNS 2026 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2026-05-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"L. Thomson","x":"We are embedding security, governance and controls into the foundation of our AI infrastructure by design, enabling us to scale not just quickly but safely, fully aware of both the opportunities and risks of advanced AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/29/bns-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BNS 2026 Q2","e":"bns","d":"2026-05-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"L. Thomson","x":"I mean the business community kind of has appreciated that now, which is a significant difference than a year ago and that it may continue to evolve and there may be tariffs on specific sectors, and there may be some industries that are impacted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/29/bns-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BNS 2026 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2026-08-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"L. Thomson","x":"The bank remains focused on deploying accumulated capital in support of Canada's economy including helping fund areas of national importance such as natural resources, critical infrastructure, AI and defense, and we expect to do all of this while maintaining strong capital ratios.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/scotiabank-bns-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNS 2026 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2026-08-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"L. Thomson","x":"We are delivering strong and consistent results across the bank, while still investing in the future, including in AI, where we continue to advance our enterprise-wide AI agenda with a focus on practical adoption, including training, scalable infrastructure and responsible governance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/scotiabank-bns-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNS 2026 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2026-08-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"L. Thomson","x":"While the trade relationship between Canada and the U.S. is evolving, ever since tariffs were imposed last year, the Canadian economy has proven to be much more resilient than expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/scotiabank-bns-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BNS 2026 Q3","e":"bns","d":"2026-08-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Shannon McGinnis","x":"And then if I think about tariffs, I think there's a -- I think about it in a few ways.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/scotiabank-bns-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[31,1,8858,0,0,0,6684,1770],[32,1,7283,0,0,0,5107,1779],[33,1,7493,0,0,0,5881,1233],[35,1,9687,0,0,0,7974,1358],[36,1,8761,0,0,0,7164,1302],[37,1,7860,0,0,0,6180,1355],[38,1,7282,0,0,0,6104,922],[39,1,8996,0,0,0,7117,1457],[40,1,7796,0,0,0,6429,998],[41,1,10312,0,0,0,8251,1623],[42,1,10739,0,0,0,8416,1792],[43,1,8590,0,0,0,6902,1203],[44,1,8925,0,0,0,6799,1605],[45,1,9001,0,0,0,7178,1371],[46,1,8899,0,0,0,6904,1412],[47,1,9848,0,0,0,7514,1840],[48,1,6772,0,0,0,5680,701],[49,1,9122,0,0,0,7371,1312],[50,1,9978,0,0,0,8222,1320],[65,1,8705,0,0,0,5930,2529],[66,1,9378,0,0,0,7991,1096]],"cinema":[[31,1,8858,0,0,0,6684,1770],[32,1,7283,0,0,0,5107,1779],[33,1,7493,0,0,0,5881,1233],[35,1,9687,0,0,0,7974,1358],[36,1,8761,0,0,0,7164,1302],[37,1,7860,0,0,0,6180,1355],[38,1,7282,0,0,0,6104,922],[39,1,8996,0,0,0,7117,1457],[40,1,7796,0,0,0,6429,998],[41,1,10312,0,0,0,8251,1623],[42,1,10739,0,0,0,8416,1792],[43,1,8590,0,0,0,6902,1203],[44,1,8925,0,0,0,6799,1605],[45,1,9001,0,0,0,7178,1371],[46,1,8899,0,0,0,6904,1412],[47,1,9848,0,0,0,7514,1840],[48,1,6772,0,0,0,5680,701],[49,1,9122,0,0,0,7371,1312],[50,1,9978,0,0,0,8222,1320],[65,1,8705,0,0,0,5930,2529],[66,1,9378,0,0,0,7991,1096]],"imax":[[31,1,8858,0,0,0,6684,1770],[32,1,7283,